## 2. Ring Buffer 패턴 (안전한 데이터 전달용)

### 2-1. SyscallRingBuffer (가장 완성된 구현)
**파일**: `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-os-kernel/src/security/syscall_interceptor.fl`

```fl
pub struct SyscallRingBuffer {
    pub buffer: Vec<SyscallEvent>,
    pub head: usize,
    pub tail: usize,
    pub capacity: usize,
}

impl SyscallRingBuffer {
    pub fn new(capacity: usize) -> Self { ... }

    pub fn push(&mut self, event: SyscallEvent) -> bool {
        let next_head = (self.head + 1) % self.capacity;
        if next_head == self.tail { return false; }  // full 감지
        self.buffer[self.head] = event;
        self.head = next_head;
        true
    }

    pub fn pop(&mut self) -> Option<SyscallEvent> {
        if self.tail == self.head { return None; }
        let event = self.buffer[self.tail];
        self.tail = (self.tail + 1) % self.capacity;
        Some(event)
    }

    pub fn len(&self) -> usize {
        if self.head >= self.tail { self.head - self.tail }
        else { self.capacity - (self.tail - self.head) }
    }

    pub fn is_full(&self) -> bool {
        (self.head + 1) % self.capacity == self.tail
    }
}
```

**ZKP 재사용 포인트**: `SyscallRingBuffer`를 `ZKProofBuffer`로 그대로 복사 재사용. proof 데이터를 생산자-소비자 패턴으로 안전하게 전달하는 데 이상적.

---

