## 3. 검증/인증 패턴 (validate 함수들)

### 3-1. 다층 검증 패턴 (ai_watchdog.fl)
**파일**: `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/freelang-nano-kernel/src/services/ai_watchdog.fl`

```fl
// 범위 검증 패턴 (ZKP range proof 구현에 재사용)
pub fn validate_performance_metrics(metrics: &PerformanceMetrics) -> bool {
    metrics.validate()
}

impl PerformanceMetrics {
    pub fn validate(&self) -> bool {
        self.throughput >= 0.0 &&
        self.latency_us >= 0.0 &&
        self.thermal_temp_c >= -10.0 && self.thermal_temp_c <= 150.0 &&
        self.cpu_utilization >= 0.0 && self.cpu_utilization <= 1.0 &&
        self.cache_hit_rate >= 0.0 && self.cache_hit_rate <= 1.0
    }
}

// 특화 검증 함수들
pub fn validate_autonomy_rate(rate: f32) -> bool { rate >= 99.0 && rate <= 100.0 }
pub fn validate_improvement(improvement_pct: f32) -> bool { improvement_pct > 10.0 }
pub fn validate_watchdog_action(throttled: bool, temp: f32) -> bool { ... }
```

**ZKP 재사용 포인트**: `validate()` 패턴이 ZKP의 "witness satisfies constraint" 검증과 동일한 구조. 범위 조건들(`>= 0.0 && <= 1.0`)이 ZKP range proof로 변환 가능.

